{
    "version": "1.3.1",
    "description": "Official Windows desktop client for YunX (云析): browse netdisk share links and video links, preview online, and download at high speed with multi-account support.",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/tidain/YunX-Desktop",
    "license": "AGPL-3.0-only",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/tidain/YunX-Desktop/releases/download/v1.3.1/YunX-Desktop-v1.3.1-win64-portable.zip",
            "hash": "29ef118c4f90cead4e3b0a420ac5dc0c03fb7615187841738b2db0d911ba701e"
        }
    },
    "bin": "YunX-Desktop.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "YunX-Desktop.exe",
            "云析 YunX-Desktop"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": "data",
    "env_set": {
        "YUNX_DESKTOP_DATA_DIR": "$persist_dir\\data"
    },
    "post_install": [
        "$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'",
        "$dest = Join-Path $persist_dir 'data'",
        "$legacy = @((Join-Path $env:USERPROFILE '.yunx-desktop'), (Join-Path $env:USERPROFILE '.yunx-pc')) | Where-Object { Test-Path -LiteralPath $_ } | Select-Object -First 1",
        "if ($legacy -and -not (Test-Path -LiteralPath (Join-Path $dest 'yunx.db'))) {",
        "    New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $dest | Out-Null",
        "    foreach ($item in 'yunx.db', 'yunx.db-wal', 'yunx.db-shm', 'credential.key', 'files') {",
        "        $src = Join-Path $legacy $item",
        "        if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $src) { Copy-Item -LiteralPath $src -Destination $dest -Recurse -Force }",
        "    }",
        "    info \"Copied existing YunX data from $legacy to $dest (source kept)\"",
        "}"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "便携版直接解压运行，不写注册表安装项；开始菜单快捷方式在 Scoop Apps 下。",
        "数据目录：用户环境变量 YUNX_DESKTOP_DATA_DIR = persist\\yunx-desktop\\data，账号库（yunx.db + credential.key）、内嵌浏览器缓存与日志都在这里；升级和 scoop uninstall（不带 -p）都不会丢。",
        "首次安装若 %USERPROFILE%\\.yunx-desktop（或旧版 .yunx-pc）已有数据，会把账号库/密钥/日志复制到 persist（源目录保留）；下载分片与内嵌浏览器缓存不复制，网页版登录态需重新登录。",
        "升级请用 scoop update yunx-desktop；应用内「检查更新」只下载安装包到下载目录，不要拿它覆盖 Scoop 目录。",
        "要求 Windows 10/11 x64；应用内「储存目录 → 应用所在目录」预设通过 junction 落在同一个 persist 目录。"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/tidain/YunX-Desktop"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/tidain/YunX-Desktop/releases/download/v$version/YunX-Desktop-v$version-win64-portable.zip"
            }
        }
    }
}
